Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DLNet <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: DLNet: Top-K PyTorch deep-learning baselines for a dataset, and an MCP server
 Turns a dataset into trained, evaluated PyTorch baselines (CPU build) and serves the same
 tools to AI clients over MCP (dlnet serve). Installed in /opt/dlnet, command /usr/bin/dlnet.
